{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07336","headline":"桂阳西州晚泊古桥村住人 · 刘长卿","name":"桂阳西州晚泊古桥村住人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳别离久，江上心可得。\n惆怅增暮情，潇湘复秋色。\n故山隔何处，落日羡归翼。\n沧海空自流，白鸥不相识。\n悲蛬满荆渚，辍櫂徒沾臆。\n行客念寒衣，主人愁夜织。\n帝乡片云去，遥寄千里忆。\n南路随天长，征帆杳无极。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07336.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07336","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}